parsing pod.yml: error converting YAML to JSON: yaml: line 8: mapping values are not allowed in this context

This error:

parsing pod.yml: error converting YAML to JSON: yaml: line 8: mapping values are not allowed in this context
means 👉 there is a YAML syntax problem, usually related to indentation or incorrect use of : (colon).

🔹 Most Common Reasons
1. ❌ Wrong Indentation
YAML is very strict about spaces (not tabs).

👉 Example (WRONG):

spec:
containers:
- name: nginx
👉 Correct:

spec:
  containers:
  - name: nginx
2. ❌ Missing space after :
👉 Wrong:

name:nginx
👉 Correct:

name: nginx
3. ❌ Extra or misplaced :
👉 Wrong:

image: nginx:latest:1
👉 Correct:

image: nginx:latest
4. ❌ Mixing tabs and spaces
YAML only supports spaces

Tabs will break parsing

5. ❌ Incorrect key-value structure
👉 Wrong:

- name nginx
👉 Correct:

- name: nginx
🔹 How to Debug (Quick Steps)
Go to line 8 in your pod.yml

Check:

indentation (2 spaces recommended)

colon : usage

spacing after :

